+lines += ['', '## Surprises','', '- Register-allocation reasoning dominated every populated cohort; many residuals were operand-coloring problems after instruction/control-flow shape already matched.', '- Workers repeatedly rejected higher-scoring candidates when they were semantically wrong, implausible authored source, or regressed an exact neighbor.', '- Tooling failures were material: several summaries used qemu-i386 workarounds or could not run official validation.', '- The batch has no exact workers despite containing 20 near misses, so it offers stall evidence but no self-reported closing factors.']
